  "notes": "Added by the verifier: released on 2024-07-16 together with Mathstral (changelog) and missing from the research output. familyId left null until the scope assigns a family (a Codestral family is the likely home). The announcement names the la Plateforme id codestral-mamba-2407; the changelog and docs use open-codestral-mamba. The overview names Codestral as the alternative without a version, so replacedBy is not recorded. Mistral says it was designed with help from Albert Gu and Tri Dao and is based on the Mamba architecture; no model relation is recorded."
